OL,3,GNEWSAPolice order after eggs thrown at
OL,4,Apeople and homes
OL,5,
OL,6,FA dispersal order has been put in place
OL,7,Fin a Lincolnshire town following
OL,8,Freports of eggs and stones being thrown
OL,9,Fat people and buildings.
OL,11,FLincolnshire Police said some incidents
OL,12,Fof anti-social behaviour in Sutton
OL,13,FBridge had "crossed the threshold into
OL,14,Fcriminality".
OL,16,FThe order running from Saturday morning
OL,17,Funtil 08:00 BST on Monday allows
OL,18,Fofficers to force people to leave
OL,19,Fspecific areas of the town or face
OL,20,Farrest.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
